 "description": "What is the current JMA Volcanic Alert Level (1-5, or warning kind) of this volcano or of every JMA-monitored volcano? Name in English or Japanese, or 3-digit JMA code. Returns JMA English and Japanese names, level, previous level and change, issue time, prefectures named in JMA bulletins, source URL and freshness receipt. Relay only; no forecast or interpretation. Gaps filled from JMA website lists (newer wins). No JMA source seen = not_seen_in_checked_feeds, never assumed level 1.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
